208 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 80 0 R
/T (True Vine Mission was founded by three mothers whose sons communicate through the Spellers Method, spelling out words, letter by letter, on a letter board. Each had watched her own son go from being assumed incapable to expressing complex, capable thoughts once given the right access point. )
/E (True Vine Mission was founded by three mothers whose sons communicate through the Spellers Method, spelling out words, letter by letter, on a letter board. Each had watched her own son go from being assumed incapable to expressing complex, capable thoughts once given the right access point. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
209 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 80 0 R
/T (That experience became a conviction: every nonspeaking and minimally speaking student deserves to be presumed competent from day one, not after they've proven it, but as the starting point. True Vine exists to build a school, and eventually a permanent campus, around that conviction.)
/E (That experience became a conviction: every nonspeaking and minimally speaking student deserves to be presumed competent from day one, not after they've proven it, but as the starting point. True Vine exists to build a school, and eventually a permanent campus, around that conviction.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
210 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 80 0 R
/T (True Vine exists to build a school, and eventually a permanent campus, around that conviction, a place where presumed competence isn't a slogan on the wall but the operating assumption behind every lesson, every therapy session, every interaction. What started as three mothers' shared refusal to accept less for their sons is becoming a model for how an entire community can choose to see these students differently.)
