441 0 obj
<<
/Title (True Vine exists to build a school, and eventually a permanent campus, around that conviction, a place where presumed competence isn't a slogan on the wall but the operating assumption behind every lesson, every therapy session, every interaction. What started as three mothers' shared refusal to accept less for their sons is becoming a model for how an entire community can choose to see these students differently.)
